--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
command: attack bones
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> attack bones
A ghost appears in the room and is appalled at your having desecrated the remains of a fellow adventurer. He casts a curse on all of your valuables and orders them banished to the Land of the Living Dead. The ghost leaves, muttering obscenities.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
command: inventory
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> inventory
You have no possessions.

